X|Core services: ProcessRunner, StateStore, GitService, WorktreeService, Orchestrator
X|Adding a test framework such as xunit
X|Restyling, new colour schemes, new panels or new keybindings
X|README ASCII art edits (a later documentation pass owns those)
U|East Asian width data is not exposed directly by the BCL. Implement a compact range table for Wide/Fullwidth plus zero-width combining marks rather than taking a dependency; state the ranges covered in the report.
U|Brief #2 already landed src/FKNRTD.Core/Properties/AssemblyInfo.cs with InternalsVisibleTo("FKNRTD.SelfTest"); follow that existing pattern rather than inventing a new one.
